OrionLayer open fix 77 — the fighter pass's beam and group
==========================================================

Work order 212 (Part E, Data's decision 6). orion2re on `orionlayer-local`,
on top of open fix 71. Every line under ORION2RE_EXT.

`Fighter_Combat_SFX_` (cmbtmis.cpp:875-970) draws, at each fighter pass, the
group firing its owner's best point-defence beam (`_fighter_beam_type`,
initship.cpp:1061-1091) from a quarter of its fighters at the target point;
none of it was on the wire. Where the original draws the pass, CEV_FIGHTER_BEAM
is recorded after CEV_FIGHTER_PASS: the missile, the beam weapon, the group's
x and y (px), its facing and quantity, the target point (px).

diff --git a/src/ext/ext_api.h b/src/ext/ext_api.h
index 9c5a56ef..f59226cd 100644
--- a/src/ext/ext_api.h
+++ b/src/ext/ext_api.h
@@ -178,6 +178,7 @@ enum CombatEventType : uint8_t {
     CEV_COMMAND = 18,       // op, result (0 taken, else why refused), a, b — OrionLayer, open fix 58.
     CEV_SOUND = 19,         // sound id, handle, ticks since the last other event — OrionLayer, open fix 79.
     CEV_SOUND_CHANGE = 20,  // handle (-1 every sound), change (1 fade, 2 loop, 3 pitch), value, ticks — OrionLayer, open fix 79.
+    CEV_FIGHTER_BEAM = 21,  // missile, beam weapon, group x px, y px, facing, quantity, target x px, y px — OrionLayer, open fix 77.
 };
 
 /// OrionLayer, open fix 58. One command per battle action (decision 52), consumed where the human's input is read.
